{"baseRefName":"docs/home-redesign-workshop","baseRefOid":"356792b5b78cb6642039abc1ad259c6e59d2d3bc","body":"## Summary\n\nLighthouse follow-ups. Stacked on the home redesign PR.\n\n- **Search is loaded on demand.** The dialog (search client + Orama, ~265 KB of JS) was imported into the root layout, so every page paid for it before a key was pressed. It now mounts on first open, and the first real input anywhere warms the chunk so Ctrl+K stays instant. A test fails if the layout imports it eagerly again.\n- **Fixes a real accessibility failure.** The override that lifts code comments off the highlighter's 3.7:1 grey matched `--shiki-dark: #6A737D` with a space, but the server writes it without one, so it matched nothing in the served HTML. `test/palette.test.ts` had pinned the buggy spelling, which is how a dead rule stayed green. Accessibility is now 100 on all nine audited pages (it was 96–97 on two).\n\n## Measured, and what is deliberately not changed\n\n- Observed (unthrottled-trace) LCP is 81–467 ms on every audited page. The ~3.9 s figure is Lighthouse's simulated slow-4G / 4× CPU model, so this PR does not claim an LCP win. Single-run performance scores moved both ways between runs (e.g. troubleshooting 62 → 74, `/docs` 83 → 79) with no relevant change, which is noise; please judge the JS saving by bytes, not by that score.\n- The nav's \"Analytics\" link makes Next prefetch the chart route (a 143 KB chunk unused elsewhere). It is low priority and Fumadocs' link items expose no `prefetch` option, so avoiding it would mean re-implementing the nav link's styling for a small gain.\n- `troubleshooting` still has a CLS of 0.015 from the fox banner copy (well inside \"good\"); not chased.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `bun run typecheck`, `lint`, `fmt:check`, `test` in `apps/docs` (403 pass)\n- [x] `bun run lighthouse:docs`: accessibility 100 on all nine pages\n- [ ] Open search with Ctrl+K on a cold load in a real browser and confirm it opens without a visible delay\n","files":[{"path":"apps/docs/app/layout.tsx","additions":2,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/styles/docs-chrome.css","additions":7,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/search/lazy-search-dialog.tsx","additions":56,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/code-comment-contrast.test.ts","additions":42,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/lazy-search.test.tsx","additions":34,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/palette.test.ts","additions":3,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"docs/perf-lazy-search","headRefOid":"6394f4ff2e242baa38919c533e25f4d9d9036d6c","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":538,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:13Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089734884/job/111107309118","name":"Path filters","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:06Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:16Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089734870/job/111107308718","name":"Version ↔ changelog guard","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:05Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release Guard"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089734884/job/111107309082","name":"Format check","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:06Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:33Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089734884/job/111107309134","name":"Lint","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:05Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:25:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detai